[source-owned actuator, §§60.1--60.3 and 62.1](FIB_ATOM_RECURSIVE_HOLOGRAPHIC_BOUNDARY_GEOMETRY_CONTINUATION.md#60-a-source-owned-finite-actuator-for-the-installed-whole-rho-interaction).
